		{
			dependencies: ["51535B36BB7357D4"]
			description: [
				"&6The Skillet&r is a &cweapon&r and a portable &efood-cooking&r station, which can be &aoperated&r by &ehand&r or as a &eblock&r."
				""
				"&6煎锅&r可以&a处理&r任何&e篝火&r烹饪配方，烹饪每样物品大约需要原&e20%&r的&e时间&r来&a烹饪&r。"
				""
				"它有&e2&r种&a操作&r模式："
				""
				"  ● When a player is &awielding&r a &6Skillet&r close to any &cheat sources&r, they'll be able to &acook&r any valid items in their &eopposite hand&r by &aholding&r the &ainteract&r button."
				""
				"如果玩家身上有&c火&r，他们可以在任何地方用手&c操作&r&6煎锅&r。"
				""
				""
				"  ● Players can &asneak-interact&r the &6Skillet&r to &aplace&r it down as a &eblock&r. If &aplaced&r &5above&r a valid &cheat source&r, it will be able to &acook&r food items placed on it. &6Skillet&r can &ahold&r on to a single &estack&r of items, &adropping&r them to the &5right side&r (handle pointing to the observer) when finished, requiring an item catcher to &acollect&r the items. &5Hoppers&r or &5Baskets&r are &erecommended&r."
				""
				"---"
				""
				"&6Skillets&r can be used as a &cheavyweight melee weapon&r. They &adeal&r slightly less &cdamage&r than an &6Iron Axe&r and have the same &eswing speed&r, but also possess higher &5knockback&r on each hit (roughly &e2x&r as much). Their &9durability&r is the same as any Iron tool."
				""
				"&6煎锅&r可以&a获得&r与&6剑&r相同的&5附魔&r，但&c除外&r的是&5横扫之刃&r。"
				""
				"&5火焰附魔&r将&a略微&r提高煎锅的&e烹饪速度&r，手持和放置模式均有效。作为&e方块&r，被加热的&5火焰附魔&r煎锅会&a发出&r&d魔法火花&r来表示这一点。"
			]
