		{
			description: [
				"&6绳索&r是一种由&6稻草&r制成的可&a攀爬&r和&a部署&r的方块。"
				""
				""
				"&6绳索&r是&a无形的&r，但可以&a攀爬&r的方块，其行为与&6藤蔓&r和&6梯子&r类似。要攀爬它们，只需在&a接触&r时按住&a跳跃&r键。"
				""
				"When &aplacing&6 Rope&r, you can &ause&r more &6ropes&r against the &6first one&r to &adeploy&r them &5downward&r. This will continuously &aextend&r a column of &6rope&r down to the &ebottom-most Y-level&e possible, allowing for &aeasy&r and &acontrollable&r descents into chasms, ravines or from high locations."
				""
				"To &asuppress&r &6rope&r deployment, simply &asneak&r while &aplacing&r it. If there's &cno space&r underneath to &adeploy&r, it will also &aplace&r normally."
				""
				"如果一个&6铃铛&r位于最多&e24&r根绳子的&5正上方&r，那么这些&6绳子&r可以被&a互动&r以&a敲响&r这个&6铃铛&r。铃铛正下方的&6绳子&r会与其&a在视觉上相连&r。"
				""
				"&6绳索&r可以代替&a线&r和&6史莱姆&r&6来&r制作&a单个&r牵引绳&6&r，或者&a编织&r成&6安全网&r。"
			]
