		{
			description: [
				"&6篮子&r是一种&a容器方块&r，可以通过开口捕捉掉落物品，就像&5漏斗&r一样。"
				""
				"&6篮子&r可以&a朝向任意一个&e6&r个基本&5方向&r&r放置，甚至可以&e倒置&r使用。与它&5开口面&r&a碰撞&r的物品会被&a捕获&r并&a存储&r在它的&e物品栏&r中。"
				""
				"It has the same &einventory size&r as a &6Chest&r or &6Barrel&r, but &clacks&r the ability to actively &atransfer&r items between blocks, such as &aextracting&r from, or &ainserting&r into, &aadjacent&r inventories. Other item-transferring blocks can &ainteract&r with a &6Basket&r normally."
				""
				"它们和&5Hopper&r一样，有类似的&a捕获&r &c冷却时间&r，并且同样可以用&c红石&r信号来&c禁用&r。"
				""
				"When &bwaterlogged&r, a &6Basket&r will fully &acontain&r the &bwater&r within itself, only letting it &aflow out&r of its &5open side&r. The &bwaterlogged&r &6Basket&r will still &acount&r as a &eblock of water&r to its &5neighbors&r, allowing for &asafe&r crop hydration, and even compact &eCobblestone&r generation machines."
			]
			id: "6F7D460A44CB966C"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "点击任务图标以显示更多信息"
